# The code-server release tarball and its extracted tree are ~900 MB of third-party
# build output; they are reproducible from github.com/coder/code-server releases.
cs.tar.gz
code-server-*/
# Node runtime (reused from dsh-android, itself reproducible from nodejs.org)
rt/
node_modules/
*.apk

# Cloned upstream sources for the native modules (reproducible via git clone)
native/*/
!native/*.md
